[NIST SP 800-171]  3.12.1 (Periodically assess security controls in organisational systems including third parties)$p$, $p$Critical$p$, $p$Third-party supplier register listing all processors/operators; pre-engagement security assessment questionnaires; risk assessment reports for each supplier; evidence of security accreditation (ISO 27001, SOC 2 Type II, Cyber Essentials) for high-risk suppliers$p$, $p$Implement a formal supplier security assessment process. Require all operators and processors to complete a security questionnaire before onboarding. For high-risk suppliers, obtain independent security assurance (ISO 27001 certificate, SOC 2 Type II report, penetration test summary). Maintain a supplier register with risk classification.$p$, $p$all$p$, $p$popia.s4.q24$p$),
